    "reviews": "\u201cI am fascinated with the game, it is simple and at the same time robust, my gameplays have been fun, I am addicted, I have spent the last 8 hours playing this straight. The game gets me stuck and I always want to earn more and more money and improve my business.\u201d<br>Steam Reviewer<br><br>\u201cIt is a game really made for people who love management games, if you like this style of game I recommend you try it out. I think I can already say that it is one of my favorite games at the moment!\u201d<br>Steam Reviewer<br>",
